Hi Avery,

Every new tool your team adopts wants the same customer data: who signed up, what they did, which plan they're on. Without a central pipe, engineers end up writing the same integration five times.

Segment collects events once from your product and sends them to every destination: Mixpanel, HubSpot, Intercom, Snowflake, your warehouse, your ad platforms. Add a tool in a click, not a sprint.

The Segment Startup Program offers up to $50,000 in credits for companies under $5M in funding, plus:
- 300+ integrations
- Identity resolution across web, mobile, and backend
- A free warehouse sync to Snowflake or BigQuery

